ing a choice. |')\ns=s.replace('input edges under loss, stale epoch rejection,','input edges under loss, visibility clock handoff with no RAF, stale epoch rejection,')\ns=s.replace('full attract feature coverage using the real contact path.','full attract feature coverage on every looped route using the real contact path. The kiosk stages its last-contact redirect so normal bot skill cannot skip the broken-pick demonstration.')\np.write_text(s)\np=dev/'docs/testing-sim.md';s=p.read_text().replace('29 substantive cases','30 substantive cases');s=s.replace('- Unique room/ladder/door IDs;','- A fourth authored room, configurable finale conditions and data-driven expedition end need no core changes.\\\\n- Unique room/ladder/door IDs;');p.write_text(s)\nPY\nbiome check --write src/main.js tests/packaging.mjs --diagnostic-level=error\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
